### Payload Size Test
```bash
# Test MAX_CONTENT_LENGTH (16MB limit)
# Create a file larger than 16MB
dd if=/dev/zero of=/tmp/large_payload.bin bs=1M count=20

# Attempt to upload
curl -X POST http://localhost:15000/api/chat/start \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  --data-binary @/tmp/large_payload.bin

# Expected: 413 Payload Too Large error
```

